[Music]  what's up Wolfgang if you are not aware  the licensing Expo is currently underway  in Las Vegas and at the licensing Expo  they released a new promo poster for  Aquaman and this promo poster revealed  to us that Aquaman has a brand new look  his new suit not only has a new look but  it looks like it has some armor upgrades  as well we'll be talking about his new  look in this video and the possibility  of the first trailer for Aquaman coming  out pretty soon but before we started if  you're new to this channel hit that  subscribe button and you'll be entered  into our speaker system giveaway and the  rest of the details for the giveaway are  in the description below so there are  obviously some major differences between  the suit that he was wearing in Justice  League and the suit that he's wearing in  this promo poster for starters it's not  a full suit it's not covering you know  every part of his body with the  exception of his hands it's only  covering a majority of his body you can  see where it's showing the stomach and  it's showing his arms and we can't see  the legs but it could possibly be  showing some of the legs as well so they  ditched the old green armor that kind of  looked like it had a bunch of scales all  over it and this seems to be more of a  natural Aquaman suit to me not in the  aspect of this is what it looks like in  the comics because obviously it's not  the old one looks more like the comics  and this one does but in the fact that  if I if there was a real-life Aquaman  I feel like this is what he would be  wearing it just sort of seems like it's  made from the sea it's just sort of  natural to me and it seems more  protective to me you can see on his  shoulders he's got armor there and he's  wearing a chest plate and he's got  protection over the top parts of his  legs on the sides as you can see right  below his belt there and it looks really  solid sturdy and strong I'd really hate  to take a shoulder charge from this guy  while he's behind those shoulder pads  but let's talk about the color this  armor is more orange than the armor that  he wore in Justice League and this may  be James Wan paying tribute to the  original suit from the comics well at  the same time keeping it realist  and that's the great thing about James  Wan he does keep it realistic I mean I  guess to the best you can when you're  talking about superheroes who live  underwater  and while we're on the topic of color it  looks like they kind of took the blond  out of his hair which is interesting  because it was a pretty big controversy  when Jason Momoa was cast as Aquaman a  Justice League because he doesn't have  really blonde hair like Aquaman does in  the comics and maybe this is them just  embracing the fact that hey okay he  doesn't have blonde hair but he's  Aquaman kind of deal with it we're not  gonna put a little bit of blonde in  there deal with it and one thing that I  did notice is the rings that he has on  his fingers he's wearing two and he  wasn't wearing any in Justice League my  first thoughts are that one is a radio  ring that he uses to communicate with  Mara or Queen Atlanta or arm and the  other I assume has the crest of Atlantis  on it or as a Royal heirloom or  something like that so that's a new suit  and it's been the first thing in a long  time that's been released to us about  Aquaman and it's exciting because it's  getting closer it comes out in December  at the end of this year and recently  there was footage of it shown at  CinemaCon last month and evidently it  was fantastic and there's been a lot of  talk about Aquaman saving the DCE you we  had a great refresher with Wonder Woman  that was awesome and then Justice League  came and it was not so good and there's  been a lot of talk about this a lot of  talk about Aquaman revitalizing it yet  again picking off from where Wonder  Woman left off with great DC movies  which you know we haven't had that many  yet and James Wan is a perfectionist so  I'm really excited to see his take on  this movie now it was said that the  footage that was shown last month at  CinemaCon was not finalized footage it  was unfinished  according to James Wan and was not meant  to be an official trailer for Aquaman  but apparently there is a rumor going  around at the licensing Expo that the  trailer for Aquaman will be released  within the next few weeks this lines up  because it comes out in December and the  movies that are coming out in November  the trailers for them were released this  week so it makes sense that the trailer  would be released in the next few weeks  because the movie  is released in December so that's it for  this video let me know what you guys  think of Aquaman's new suit that he's  wearing in this poster and let me know  if you think this is actually going to  be a good DC movie hopefully we can just  ignore Justice League and have Aquaman  be on the same level that Wonder Woman  was and just start with good DC EU  movies and hopefully we get the trailer  for Aquaman soon again let me know your  thoughts in the comments below and if  you enjoyed this video click that thumbs  up button for me and be sure to  subscribe to my channel to stay up to  date on the Aquaman DC and all things  superhero thank you so much for watching  woof woof  [Music]  [Music]

